# Reconciliation statement balances

- Opening and ending are stored on `ReconciliationPeriod` (`statementOpeningBalance`, `statementEndingBalance`).
- Set them at `POST /api/reconciliation/period`, or change an **OPEN** period with `PATCH /api/reconciliation/period/:id`.
- Do not add an adjustment entry to force close. Difference is `ending − (opening + cleared net)`.
- Closed periods cannot be edited.

Details: `.agent/logic/reconciliation.mdc`.
